name bnumexpr
category Package
revision 59244
shortdesc Extends eTeX's \numexpr...\relax construct to big integers
longdesc The package extends e-TeX \numexpr...\relax operation to allow
longdesc big integers, powers, factorials, truncated division and its
longdesc associated modulo. By default, bnumexpr loads package xintcore
longdesc (part of the xint bundle) and uses its arithmetic macros.
